# Visual system

- No house palette. Do not invent a dark emerald ground, gold accents, or an "emerald night" theme. Color comes from the brief or from the page already on screen.
- No red-yellow-green flag stripes.
- Decorative art is generated, never emoji/sticker glyphs. Raw renders go through
  `scripts/process-art-v2.py` (Real-ESRGAN x4 upscale -> magenta chroma key -> WebP in `frontend/public/img/**`).
- Styles: `frontend/public/css/main.css` (global stylesheet, linked from `frontend/index.html`; React components use its class names). Font Rubik is self-hosted (`frontend/public/css/fonts.css`, `frontend/public/fonts/`).
- Partner styling is keyed by `data-partner` (`stake`, otherwise `generic`); partner bonus cards come from `frontend/src/shared/site.ts` -> `partners`.
- All UI text is English.
- Do not restyle the admin panel (`frontend/src/admin/**`, `frontend/admin/index.html`, `frontend/public/css/admin.css`).
